        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Revealing Nature</title>\n  <script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n  <script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html, body {\n      margin: 0;\n      width: 540px;\n      height: 766px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background: #fff;\n    }\n    body {\n      font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n      color: #31302f;\n    }\n    .page {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 540px;\n      height: 766px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(to bottom, #ffffff 0 74px, #f1f1ef 74px 77px, #f7f7f4 77px 705px, #ffffff 705px 100%);\n    }\n    .reading {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 101px;\n      left: 52px;\n      width: 437px;\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 196px 205px;\n      column-gap: 19px;\n      font-size: 10.5px;\n      line-height: 1.22;\n    }\n    .column { position: relative; }\n    .para {\n      position: relative;\n      margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n      padding-left: 16px;\n    }\n    .para .num {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 0;\n      top: 0;\n      font-size: 8px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .intro {\n      padding-left: 16px;\n      margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n    }\n    .p3 { margin-top: 1px; }\n    .p4 { margin-top: 17px; }\n    .p5 { margin-top: 0; }\n    .p6 { margin-top: 18px; }\n    .p7 { margin-top: 21px; }\n\n    .highlight {\n      background: rgba(229, 170, 237, .72);\n      padding: 0 1px;\n    }\n    .ink-circle {\n      position: absolute;\n      border: 1.4px solid rgba(67, 109, 157, .8);\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      pointer-events: none;\n      z-index: 2;\n    }\n    .c1 { width: 56px; height: 17px; left: 87px; top: 20px; transform: rotate(-7deg); }\n    .c2 { width: 42px; height: 18px; left: 77px; top: 93px; transform: rotate(-10deg); }\n    .c3 { width: 70px; height: 18px; left: 36px; top: 116px; transform: rotate(-10deg); }\n    .c4 { width: 56px; height: 19px; left: 45px; top: 136px; transform: rotate(-4deg); }\n    .c5 { width: 58px; height: 18px; left: 62px; top: 183px; transform: rotate(-4deg); }\n    .c6 { width: 55px; height: 18px; left: 82px; top: 213px; transform: rotate(-8deg); }\n    .c7 { width: 55px; height: 18px; left: 15px; top: 15px; transform: rotate(-6deg); }\n    .c8 { width: 60px; height: 19px; left: 68px; top: 43px; transform: rotate(-7deg); }\n    .c9 { width: 53px; height: 18px; left: 3px; top: 111px; transform: rotate(-7deg); }\n\n    .vocab {\n      position: absolute;\n      z-index: 5;\n      background: rgba(219, 164, 246, .86);\n      color: #111;\n      font-family: Arial, \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      line-height: 1.45;\n      padding: 7px 7px 5px 7px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .vocab p { margin: 0; }\n    .vocab-top {\n      left: 289px;\n      top: 7px;\n      width: 243px;\n      height: 76px;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      line-height: 1.43;\n      padding-left: 6px;\n    }\n    .vocab-left-one {\n      left: 1px;\n      top: 431px;\n      width: 285px;\n      height: 129px;\n      border-bottom: 5px solid #0e7381;\n    }\n    .vocab-left-two {\n      left: 1px;\n      top: 565px;\n      width: 285px;\n      height: 107px;\n      border-top: 1px solid #9182b4;\n    }\n    .vocab-right {\n      left: 296px;\n      top: 430px;\n      width: 233px;\n      height: 242px;\n      border-bottom: 5px solid #0e7381;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      line-height: 1.43;\n      padding-left: 5px;\n    }\n    .underline {\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #222;\n    }\n    .footer {\n      position: absolute;\n      right: 51px;\n      bottom: 40px;\n      font: bold 9px Arial, sans-serif;\n      color: #222;\n    }\n    .footer span {\n      margin-left: 22px;\n      font-size: 10px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"reading\">\n      <div class=\"column\">\n        <p class=\"intro\">\n          their natural environments. After Darwin had<br>\n          spent some time in South America, his mind on<br>\n          the ship was crowded with <span class=\"highlight\">samples of the plants</span><br>\n          and animals he had collected. As he studied<br>\n          these, he asked himself the question: how did<br>\n          different species come to exist?\n        </p>\n\n        <p class=\"para p3\">\n          <span class=\"num\">3</span>\n          At that time, people believed that all species<br>\n          had appeared on Earth at the same time, and<br>\n          had not changed since. But Darwin began to<br>\n          think differently. He noticed that some species<br>\n          of animals were very similar to each other.<br>\n          Maybe animals <span class=\"highlight\">evolved as they adapted</span> to their<br>\n          changing environments. It was just an idea, but<br>\n          enough to inspire Darwin to look for more evidence.\n        </p>\n\n        <p class=\"para p4\">\n          <span class=\"num\">4</span>\n          When the <i>Beagle</i> reached the Galápagos<br>\n          Islands in 1835, Darwin saw <span class=\"highlight\">a variety of new</span><br>\n          species, but it was the birds that interested<br>\n          him the most. Darwin noticed that there was<br>\n          a difference between the finches on each of<br>\n          the islands. It seemed <span class=\"highlight\">their beaks had evolved</span><br>\n          according to <span class=\"highlight\">what was available</span> on that<br>\n          particular island.\n        </p>\n\n        <span class=\"ink-circle c1\"></span>\n        <span class=\"ink-circle c2\"></span>\n        <span class=\"ink-circle c3\"></span>\n        <span class=\"ink-circle c4\"></span>\n        <span class=\"ink-circle c5\"></span>\n        <span class=\"ink-circle c6\"></span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"column\">\n        <p class=\"para p5\">\n          <span class=\"num\">5</span>\n          Darwin <span class=\"highlight\">suspected</span> that the finches had evolved<br>\n          from a <span class=\"highlight\">common ancestor</span>, which had arrived on<br>\n          the islands a long time before. Over time, it had<br>\n          slowly evolved into many new species. And that<br>\n          was the answer to how new species of plants<br>\n          and animals come to exist: they evolved from<br>\n          earlier ancestors.\n        </p>\n\n        <p class=\"para p6\">\n          <span class=\"num\">6</span>\n          It was a completely new idea – a theory of<br>\n          <span class=\"highlight\">evolution</span>. Darwin explained this theory in his<br>\n          book, <i>On the Origin of Species</i>. It was not<br>\n          published until 1859 and immediately caused<br>\n          a storm. Many people refused to believe that<br>\n          living things, including humans, had evolved<br>\n          from lower forms of life. They were shocked.<br>\n          But Darwin’s scientific studies were so<br>\n          convincing that more and more people started<br>\n          to believe his theory.\n        </p>\n\n        <p class=\"para p7\">\n          <span class=\"num\">7</span>\n          Today, <i>On the Origin of Species</i> is regarded as<br>\n          one of the most important works ever written.<br>\n          It has changed ideas about life on Earth forever.<br>\n          And it all began with the journey on the <i>Beagle</i>.\n        </p>\n\n        <span class=\"ink-circle c7\"></span>\n        <span class=\"ink-circle c8\"></span>\n        <span class=\"ink-circle c9\"></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"vocab vocab-top\">\n      suspect v. 怀疑&nbsp; n. 被怀疑者；嫌疑犯<br>\n      suspect sb. of (doing) sth. 怀疑某人(干)某事<br>\n      suspect sb. to be... 猜想某人……<br>\n      It was suspected that.... 人们怀疑……\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"vocab vocab-left-one\">\n      adapt vt.（使适应；使适合；改编；改写<br>\n      (1)adapt oneself to sth. 使自己适应……<br>\n      adapt to 适应<br>\n      be adapted for... 为……改编/写；被改编成<br>\n      be adapted from... 根据……改编<br>\n      (2)adaptable adj. 能适应的；适应性强的；可改编的<br>\n      adaption/adaptation n. 适应；改编本，改写本\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"vocab vocab-left-two\">\n      available adj. 可获得的；可利用的；有空的<br>\n      (1)be available to... 可利用/获得<br>\n      be available from 从……处可获得<br>\n      make sth. available for/to sb. 使某人可以享受某物<br>\n      available resources/facilities 可利用的资源/设备<br>\n      (2)available 有效地；可获得地\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"vocab vocab-right\">\n      a variety of 各种各样的<br>\n      (1)variety n. 变化；种类<br>\n      a variety of + n = varieties of +n（可数名<br>\n      词复数或不可数名词) 各种各样的<br>\n      (2)vary vi. &amp; vt. 有变化；改变<br>\n      vary from...to... 由...到...不等<br>\n      vary between...and...由...到...不等<br>\n      vary with sth. 随着...而变化<br>\n      (3)various adj. 各种各样的；多姿多彩的<br>\n      ⚠<br>\n      (1)a variety of/varieties of 后接可数名词作<br>\n      主语时，谓语动词用复数形式；<br>\n      (2)the variety of +复数名词，意为“……的<br>\n      品种”，作主语时，谓语动词用单数形式。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">Revealing nature <span>51</span></div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
